  "details": "Repro steps:\n\n1. Start the game with Index Controllers;\n\n2. Turn controllers off, switch to quest controllers, turn off, switch back to index.\n\n3. The Index controllers outlines (usually shown in the menu) will always show, even outside the menu. Only way to fix it is to restart the game.\n\nThis bug will still occur when the controllers have been turned on at any point during the SteamVR session, even if they were turned off before the game launches. In this case, turning off the index controllers at all will trigger the bug.\n\nThere is also another bug with the one-handed locomotion menu being stuck always on, seems to be related to this one but inconsistent.",
